     "Produce the terminal stop summary for `reduce-incidental-complexity` when the generated task path handoff is malformed.\n\nStop source: malformed/missing task path from `extract-task-path`.\nUse only the `select-and-create` handoff and the `extract-task-path` output supplied as context.\nDo not consume a validated task path. Do not require, invent, or read a task path. Do not read task-local artifacts.\nReport that design/plan/test/implementation did not run because task identity could not be validated.\n\nSelection handoff:\n{{handoff}}\n\nExtraction output:\n{{extraction}}",
